sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as React frontend (Live Prediction page)
    participant API as FastAPI backend
    participant DS as DataService
    participant MS as ModelService

    User->>UI: Open /live, pick a subject + window
    UI->>API: GET /api/demo/subjects
    API->>DS: list_subjects()
    DS-->>API: subject list (from serving/demo_samples.json)
    API-->>UI: JSON

    User->>UI: Click "Run prediction"
    UI->>API: POST /api/predict?version=binary
    API->>DS: get_window(subject_id, window_index)
    DS-->>API: features + true_label
    API->>MS: predict_single(features)
    MS->>MS: scale with feature_scaler.pkl,<br/>forward pass through frozen Hybrid net
    MS-->>API: predicted_label, probabilities,<br/>attention_weights, uncertainty
    API-->>UI: PredictResponse JSON
    UI-->>User: PredictionReport: verdict, guidance,<br/>confidence, export options
